  body: "# Partner in Pension Credit guidance\n\n**Model-assisted source interpretation; unreviewed. No
    entitlement decision or executable rule.**\n\nThe captured guidance calls each member of a couple
    a partner and refers to both members as partners.\n\n## Evidence and scope\n\n[DMG 77015, PDF page
    8](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68401a731d85c6606009cce4/dmgch77.pdf#page=8) supports
    this scoped proposal. The source PDF SHA-256 is `0528f2fb95ac3bd71bdff0d91cdaba5df76ab4260396ca99608c840004ff5708`.\n\
    \nThis term requires the separate couple and household tests; it does not establish membership in
    a particular case.\n\nThe capture date, the publication page's update date and a date stated in the
    guidance have different meanings. Linked legislation and memos need their own provision, version and
    applicability review.\n"
